      "priority": "medium",
      "suggestion": "Consider adding tests for other HttpTransport methods (sendMessage, createSession, etc.)"
    }
  ],
  "praise": [
    "Good use of Config.getInstance().getAgentId() - consistent with codebase patterns",
    "The change makes session titles more identifiable by including the agent ID"
  ],
